knot
------------------------------------------
Knot DNS is a high-performance authoritative-only DNS server which supports
all key features of the domain name system including zone transfers and
DNSSEC.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libdbus1_3-1.16.2-1
  libedit0-20251016-1
  libfstrm0-0.6.1-1bl3
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgnutls30-3.8.13-1
  libhiredis1-1.4.1-1bl1
  libidn2_0-2.3.8-1
  libknot-devel-3.6.1-1bl1
  libknot17-3.6.1-1bl1
  liblmdb0-0.9.19-1
  libmaxminddb0-1.3.2-1
  libnghttp2_14-1.69.0-1
  libngtcp2_16-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls8-1.25.0-1bl1
  libprotobuf-c1-1.5.2-1bl2
  liburcu8-0.15.7-1bl1
  libzscanner-devel-3.6.1-1bl1
  libzscanner5-3.6.1-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

