Canonical website:
  https://www.knot-dns.cz/

Canonical download:
  https://secure.nic.cz/files/knot-dns/knot-3.6.1.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack knot-3.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./knot-3.6.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/knot-3.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/knot-3.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libknot17-3.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libknot-devel-3.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzscanner5-3.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libzscanner-devel-3.6.1-X.tar.xz

